     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_pasak_gevaza",
     "gloss_en": "איבעית אימא: דפסק ביה גוזא לעבודה זרה -- he cut a branch with it for the idol (= p_okimta_pasak_gevaza)",
     "answers": "obj_chadasha_meshamshei",
     "restores": "p_okimta_chadasha"
    },
    {
     "type": "objection_answer",
     "object": "ans_yeshana_shelibna",
     "gloss_en": "ואיבעית אימא: בישנה שליבנה באור -- an old knife he whitened in fire (= p_okimta_yeshana_shelibna)",
